IMAGE;VALUE=URI;DISPLAY=BADGE;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://365thingsinhouston
 .com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/4th-Annual-White-Linen-Market-at-M-K-T.jpg
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://365thingsinhouston.com/wp-content/uploads
 /2026/07/4th-Annual-White-Linen-Market-at-M-K-T.jpg
UID:iIIXpHUaGhmMD5GYGsa9z
SUMMARY:4th Annual White Linen Market at M-K-T
DTSTAMP:20260801T054341Z
DTSTART:20260801T160000Z
DESCRIPTION:For White Linen Night\, M-K-T in the Heights teams up again wit
	h Houston Plant Market for the fourth edition of the M-K-T White Linen Mar
	ket. \nCelebrating local businesses\, art\, music\, and more\, the free\, 
	all ages\, dog-friendly event offers plenty of space to spread out and soa
	k up great vibes while sipping\, shopping\, and partying during the annual
	 White Linen Night in The Heights. \nEureka Heights Brew Co. and A Force o
	f Nature will be serving tasty free beer and water. Plus there will be raf
	fle offering $1\,200 in prizes from M-K-T shopping\, dining\, and wellness
	 businesses. \nThe open-air night market will feature unique treasures\, p
	lants\, accessories\, art\, sweet treats\, and curated pop-ups from a dive
	rse H-town community of creative artisans and vendors \nA variety of roami
	ng entertainers\, local musicians\, interactive hula hooping performances\
	, and in-store DJs will enhance the block-party atmosphere. \nCheck out al
	l details\, activities\, specials and more. \nAdmission\nFree. Learn more.
	 \n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was sponsored by the event organizer 
	and boosted in our calendar with images and more details. \nLearn more abo
	ut promoting your event\, organization\, business\, or offer across all of
	 our channels.\n\nhttps://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/4th-annual-white
	-linen-market-at-m-k-t/\n\nFrom 365 Things to Do in Houston
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/4th-annual-white-linen-market-a
	t-m-k-t/
LOCATION:M-K-T\, 600 N Shepherd Dr\, Houston\, TX\, 77007\, United States
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:365-things-houston
CATEGORIES:365 Things to Do in Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT5H
END:VEVENT
