BEGIN:VEVENT
IMAGE;VALUE=URI;DISPLAY=BADGE;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://365thingsinhouston
 .com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Road-Trips-Opening-Reception-at-Archway-Ga
 llery.jpg
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://365thingsinhouston.com/wp-content/uploads
 /2026/07/Road-Trips-Opening-Reception-at-Archway-Gallery.jpg
UID:4SNIIg2bqeNw4izMkzB1m
SUMMARY:Road Trips Opening Reception at Archway Gallery
DTSTAMP:20260801T054341Z
DTSTART:20260801T170000Z
DESCRIPTION:Now celebrating its fiftieth year\, the member-owned Montrose g
	allery hosts a free opening reception for Road Trips\, an exhibit featurin
	g new paintings by Lisette McClung. \nThis exhibit brings together a colle
	ction of both plein air and studio works—large and small—inspired by her m
	any road trips over the past decade. \nPlein air—French for “open air”—ref
	ers to the practice of painting outdoors on location. As a dedicated plein
	 air painter\, McClung has been invited to paint\, explore\, and photograp
	h on a variety of working ranches\, as well as in fields\, cities\, and vi
	llages across the United States and Europe. \nThere will be an artist talk
	 at 6:30pm. \nComplimentary valet parking and light refreshments available
	. \nThe exhibit will be on display from Saturday\, August 1 through Thursd
	ay\, September 3\, 2026. \nOpened in 1976\, Archway Gallery is currently c
	elebrating its fiftieth year. \nAdmission\nFree. Learn more. If you visit 
	Archway Gallery’s website before the exhibition opens\, be sure to click o
	n “Exhibitions” in the top menu bar\, then on “Upcoming Exhibitions”\, to 
	find details on this exhibit. \n“Running Wild” by Lisette McClung | Photos
	 courtesy of Archway Gallery\n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was sponso
	red by the event organizer and boosted in our calendar with images and mor
	e details. \nLearn more about promoting your event\, organization\, busine
	ss\, or offer across all of our channels.\n\nhttps://365thingsinhouston.co
	m/calendar/road-trips-opening-reception-at-archway-gallery/\n\nFrom 365 Th
	ings to Do in Houston
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/road-trips-opening-reception-at
	-archway-gallery/
LOCATION:Archway Gallery\, 2305 Dunlavy St\, Houston\, TX\, 77006\, United 
	States
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:365-things-houston
CATEGORIES:365 Things to Do in Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT3H
END:VEVENT
