DESCRIPTION:Houston’s breakout all-female rock band Garbage Girlfriend cele
	brates the release of their self-titled debut album with a full-album live
	 performance\, plus select covers\, in The Bronze Peacock Room at House of
	 Blues \nKnown for sharp original songs and high-energy shows\, Garbage Gi
	rlfriend has been building momentum on stages across Houston and Texas. \n
	The album release show also features sets by Awaiting Abigail\, Sasser\, a
	nd AV8. \nDoors at 7pm. All ages are welcome. \nAdmission\nTickets are $20
	. Order tickets or learn more. \n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was spo
	nsored by the event organizer and boosted in our calendar with images and 
