 .com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Bun-B-Presents-Been-Ridin-Dirty-at-Smart-F
 inancial-Centre.jpeg
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://365thingsinhouston.com/wp-content/uploads
 /2026/05/Bun-B-Presents-Been-Ridin-Dirty-at-Smart-Financial-Centre.jpeg
UID:6Ir4Y2BIdFQAb6Ta0TCO3
SUMMARY:Bun B Presents Been Ridin' Dirty at Smart Financial Centre
DTSTAMP:20260801T054341Z
DTSTART:20260801T200000Z
DESCRIPTION:Smart Financial Centre welcomes Bun B Presents Been Ridin’ Dirt
	y—a one-night only live show commemorating the 30th anniversary of U.G.K.’
	s landmark 1996 album Ridin’ Dirty—on the Sugar Land stage. \nBun B will j
	oined on stage by special guests Big K.R.I.T.\, Lil’ Keke\, Slim Thug\, Da
	vid Banner\, 8Ball & MJG\, LE$\, Chamillionaire\, Killa Kyleon\, Botany bo
	yz\, Z-ro\, Devin the Dude\, and more. \nWidely regarded as a defining wor
	k in Southern hip hop\, Ridin’ Dirty introduced a sound while capturing a 
	distinct cultural point of view at a pivotal moment in the genre’s evoluti
	on. \nThe evening will unfold as a complete presentation of Ridin’ Dirty\,
	 performed in sequence & interpreted through a thoughtfully constructed li
	ve production. \nEach track is situated within a broader narrative\, drawi
	ng from the environments & lived experiences that informed the album\, off
	ering a cohesive\, start-to-finish reflection of its impact. \nBun B will 
	be at the center of the performance\, anchoring the night not only as an a
	rtist\, but as a steward of the legacy. \nAdmission\nTickets start at $35.
	 Order tickets or learn more. \n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was spon
	sored by the event organizer and boosted in our calendar with images and m
	ore details. \nLearn more about promoting your event\, organization\, busi
	ness\, or offer across all of our channels. \n\nhttps://365thingsinhouston
	.com/calendar/bun-b-presents-been-ridin-dirty-at-smart-financial-centre/\n
	\nFrom 365 Things to Do in Houston
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/bun-b-presents-been-ridin-dirty
	-at-smart-financial-centre/
LOCATION:Smart Financial Centre at Sugar Land\, 18111 Lexington Blvd\, Suga
	r Land\, TX\, 77479\, United States
